cal_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"僅保存明示子母姊與婚配來源主張。子政父系先有身敘事待覆核，不新增確證父親；所母華陽與真母夏姬分存，仲父敬號不作父親。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji085-004","subject_person_id":"cbr-p004798","predicate":"spouse","object_person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p005","quote":"呂不韋取邯鄲諸姬絕好善舞者與居，知有身。子楚從不韋飲，見而說之，因起為壽，請之。呂不韋怒，念業已破家為子楚，欲以釣奇，乃遂獻其姬。姬自匿有身，至大期時，生子政。子楚遂立姬為夫人。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子楚遂立姬為夫人","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"僅保存明示子母姊與婚配來源主張。子政父系先有身敘事待覆核，不新增確證父親；所母華陽與真母夏姬分存，仲父敬號不作父親。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji085-005","person_id":"cbr-p004798","title":"夫人","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p005","quote":"呂不韋取邯鄲諸姬絕好善舞者與居，知有身。子楚從不韋飲，見而說之，因起為壽，請之。呂不韋怒，念業已破家為子楚，欲以釣奇，乃遂獻其姬。姬自匿有身，至大期時，生子政。子楚遂立姬為夫人。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji085-005:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p005","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"夫人","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0004","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p005","quote":"呂不韋取邯鄲諸姬絕好善舞者與居，知有身。子楚從不韋飲，見而說之，因起為壽，請之。呂不韋怒，念業已破家為子楚，欲以釣奇，乃遂獻其姬。姬自匿有身，至大期時，生子政。子楚遂立姬為夫人。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授任與文獻用稱分存，未知起訖不補造。相國明示免職不終止文信侯，飲酖死亡不推定全部官爵終點；仲父為敬號非父親。篇末嫪毐文信侯歧義不作實授。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji085-017","person_id":"cbr-p004798","title":"帝太后","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p015","quote":"始皇十九年，太后薨，謚為帝太后，與莊襄王會葬茝陽。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji085-017:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p015","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"帝太后","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m015-0012","usage":"posthumous_usage"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授任與文獻用稱分存，未知起訖不補造。相國明示免職不終止文信侯，飲酖死亡不推定全部官爵終點；仲父為敬號非父親。篇末嫪毐文信侯歧義不作實授。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji085-009","person_id":"cbr-p004798","surfaces":["太后","夫人","帝太后","邯鄲諸姬絕好善舞者"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-085-lubuwei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p005","quote":"呂不韋取邯鄲諸姬絕好善舞者與居，知有身。子楚從不韋飲，見而說之，因起為壽，請之。呂不韋怒，念業已破家為子楚，欲以釣奇，乃遂獻其姬。姬自匿有身，至大期時，生子政。子楚遂立姬為夫人。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p008","quote":"莊襄王即位三年，薨，太子政立為王，尊呂不韋為相國，號稱「仲父」。秦王年少，太后時時竊私通呂不韋。不韋家僮萬人。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p010","quote":"始皇帝益壯，太后淫不止。呂不韋恐覺禍及己，乃私求大陰人嫪毐以為舍人，時縱倡樂，使毐以其陰闕桐輪而行，令太后聞之，以啗太后。太后聞，果欲私得之。呂不韋乃進嫪毐，詐令人以腐罪告之。不韋又陰謂太后曰：「可事詐腐，則得給事中。」太后乃陰厚賜主腐者吏，詐論之，拔其須眉為宦者，遂得侍太后。太后私與通，絕愛之。有身，太后恐人知之，詐卜當避時，徙宮居雍。嫪毐常從，賞賜甚厚，事皆決於嫪毐。嫪毐家僮數千人，諸客求宦為嫪毐舍人千餘人。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p012","quote":"始皇九年，有告嫪毐實非宦者，常與太后私亂，生子二人，皆匿之。與太后謀曰「王即薨，以子為後」。於是秦王下吏治，具得情實，事連相國呂不韋。九月，夷嫪毐三族，殺太后所生兩子，而遂遷太后於雍。諸嫪毐舍人皆沒其家而遷之蜀。王欲誅相國，為其奉先王功大，及賓客辯士為游說者眾，王不忍致法。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p013","quote":"秦王十年十月，免相國呂不韋。及齊人茅焦說秦王，秦王乃迎太后於雍，歸復咸陽，而出文信侯就國河南。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p015","quote":"始皇十九年，太后薨，謚為帝太后，與莊襄王會葬茝陽。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p016","quote":"太史公曰：不韋及嫪毐貴，封號文信侯。人之告嫪毐，毐聞之。秦王驗左右，未發。上之雍郊，毐恐禍起，乃與黨謀，矯太后璽發卒以反蘄年宮。發吏攻毐，毐敗亡走，追斬之好畤，遂滅其宗。而呂不韋由此絀矣。孔子之所謂「聞」者，其呂子乎？"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","quote":"秦昭王五十年，使王齮圍邯鄲，急，趙欲殺子楚。子楚與呂不韋謀，行金六百斤予守者吏，得脫，亡赴秦軍，遂以得歸。趙欲殺子楚妻子，子楚夫人趙豪家女也，得匿，以故母子竟得活。秦昭王五十六年，薨，太子安國君立為王，華陽夫人為王后，子楚為太子。趙亦奉子楚夫人及子政歸秦。"}],"rationale":"依前5段子楚質趙與呂不韋游說敘事暫接；死亡太子與後立安國君分開，華陽姊與子政母各保留未名。王稱、太子及嵌套代詞待逐處核定。 第6段子楚夫人母子得活及奉夫人子政歸秦，按第5段生子政的姬與母子承接暫接。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p005","text":"呂不韋取邯鄲諸姬絕好善舞者與居，知有身。子楚從不韋飲，見而說之，因起為壽，請之。呂不韋怒，念業已破家為子楚，欲以釣奇，乃遂獻其姬。姬自匿有身，至大期時，生子政。子楚遂立姬為夫人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0004","start":4,"end":13,"surface":"邯鄲諸姬絕好善舞者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"子政","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m005-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","text":"秦昭王五十年，使王齮圍邯鄲，急，趙欲殺子楚。子楚與呂不韋謀，行金六百斤予守者吏，得脫，亡赴秦軍，遂以得歸。趙欲殺子楚妻子，子楚夫人趙豪家女也，得匿，以故母子竟得活。秦昭王五十六年，薨，太子安國君立為王，華陽夫人為王后，子楚為太子。趙亦奉子楚夫人及子政歸秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004791","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"王齮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004800","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"守者吏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004807","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"妻子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"母子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004791","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0094","start":94,"end":97,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0101","start":101,"end":105,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"子政","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p008","text":"莊襄王即位三年，薨，太子政立為王，尊呂不韋為相國，號稱「仲父」。秦王年少，太后時時竊私通呂不韋。不韋家僮萬人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m008-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m008-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"太子政","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m008-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m008-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m008-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m008-0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m008-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m008-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"家僮","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p010","text":"始皇帝益壯，太后淫不止。呂不韋恐覺禍及己，乃私求大陰人嫪毐以為舍人，時縱倡樂，使毐以其陰闕桐輪而行，令太后聞之，以啗太后。太后聞，果欲私得之。呂不韋乃進嫪毐，詐令人以腐罪告之。不韋又陰謂太后曰：「可事詐腐，則得給事中。」太后乃陰厚賜主腐者吏，詐論之，拔其須眉為宦者，遂得侍太后。太后私與通，絕愛之。有身，太后恐人知之，詐卜當避時，徙宮居雍。嫪毐常從，賞賜甚厚，事皆決於嫪毐。嫪毐家僮數千人，諸客求宦為嫪毐舍人千餘人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"始皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0116","start":116,"end":120,"surface":"主腐者吏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0187","start":187,"end":189,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0189","start":189,"end":191,"surface":"家僮","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"諸客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0200","start":200,"end":202,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0202","start":202,"end":207,"surface":"舍人千餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p012","text":"始皇九年，有告嫪毐實非宦者，常與太后私亂，生子二人，皆匿之。與太后謀曰「王即薨，以子為後」。於是秦王下吏治，具得情實，事連相國呂不韋。九月，夷嫪毐三族，殺太后所生兩子，而遂遷太后於雍。諸嫪毐舍人皆沒其家而遷之蜀。王欲誅相國，為其奉先王功大，及賓客辯士為游說者眾，王不忍致法。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m012-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m012-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m012-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"子二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定局部指代保留，未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m012-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m012-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m012-0061","start":61,"end":66,"surface":"相國呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m012-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sh